{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "7f96ab89bd2611ef0cb81130f7b828662adffc1be3b775ccf833671061743456", "ja": "対決は続くよ、いつまでも", "zh": "对决还会继续下去，直到永远", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9ea7e18593b2256deb693bc579e6d260228f13ea38b937ad1df8cb87233e0cd7", "ja": "これで対決は終わりかと思いきや、千鶴に\n食べ比べ勝負を挑む未来と可奈。無碍にも\nできない千鶴は、半ばヤケに対決を引き\n受ける。千鶴の覚悟に感動するアイドル達。\nまだまだ対決ブームは続くようだ……。", "zh": "本以为这样对决就该结束了，没想到未来和可奈又向千鹤发起了比拼吃东西的挑战。千鹤也不好无情地拒绝，只得半赌气地接受了对决。偶像们都被千鹤的觉悟感动了。看来这股对决热潮还会继续下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c01c32f9046e5a41c3faf83d168af048bde66c68606db0a09d138c0be1420bf6", "ja": "（公演は大成功！　全力で戦い抜いたアイドル達に\n向けられる拍手は激しく、そして温かかった……）", "zh": "（公演大获成功！献上热烈而温暖的掌声，送给拼尽全力战斗到最后的偶像们……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7d5bb4ef0a3e1670eca705f189a21827a82ec567f7bbc7f08b42669898232c85", "ja": "あれ……千鶴さん？\nどうしたんですか？　そんなすみっこで。", "zh": "咦……千鹤小姐？\n怎么了？为什么待在这么偏僻的角落？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "3346f4ccb17715f4b7d9988d1c085082a2d61c0bfceb5710ddf1d0f87f8146cf", "ja": "はっ！？　{$P$}！\nシーッですわ、シーッ！", "zh": "啊！？{$P$}！\n嘘——要安静，嘘——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "3f8ba9e0cf427fed9ff464cf11ab1fe08ca6e78ed91187043991ae1cc42e8054", "ja": "あっ、千鶴さんいたっ♪\n次はマドレーヌで、ズバリ対決しましょー！", "zh": "啊，千鹤小姐在这里♪\n接下来就用玛德莲蛋糕，一决胜负吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "ad92d9ca3947f974961fbc170638e28798c1e0aa71893746842e7a0148fc4644", "ja": "ひとつは、伊織ちゃんの差し入れで、\nもうひとつがコンビニスイーツです！", "zh": "一个是伊织带来的慰问品，\n另一个是便利店甜点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "eb27de333219907a3496c9754162b7eeea386d078347911dbf1d2efbd1520664", "ja": "未来ちゃんの次は、私と～……\nのど飴で、ズバリをお願いしまーす♪", "zh": "未来之后，轮到我啦～……请直接猜出是润喉糖吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6e0955530dd986f251433bddec6af56bda36e668413a28c6579a843d0476f471", "ja": "未来に可奈……。\nズバリ対決ってことは、もしかして……。", "zh": "未来和可奈……。\n所谓的直球对决，难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "850dd50ee076a78d7b91a0ad249f22d694637e8a3e9d7e4f429d3182acf7c127", "ja": "はや～……千鶴お嬢さん、今日も大変そうだねぇ。\n朝からずっとだもの。", "zh": "好快～……千鹤大小姐，今天也挺辛苦的呢。\n从早上开始就一直这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "63cf56ba11d7f242b5aba6d19d6376dd85fcd726e5ae0d98af3ea2161e70c659", "ja": "千鶴ちゃん、みんなから『ズバリとセレブ！』対決を\n申し込まれて、休む暇もないくらいなんです。", "zh": "千鹤被大家纷纷发起『一针见血的名媛！』对决，忙得连休息的时间都没有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e12309b2579994f6305ce70a17ebb997d25313a10e6ce4519a1d646708156571", "ja": "そんなことに……。", "zh": "居然变成这样了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "5cb833518f2b8d0747922e0ecae1ff721c28bdef704e476722cdf07b79864a28", "ja": "ふたりとも、少し落ち着いたら？\n千鶴さんの迷惑になってると思うけど。", "zh": "你们两个，要不要稍微冷静一下？\n我觉得你们已经给千鹤小姐添麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "da174088e40d1fd658197992c5513e218f337bdeaf187004f2c92f3eec09d948", "ja": "えーっ？\n千鶴さん、そうなんですか？", "zh": "诶——？\n千鹤小姐，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "d1cd4c6e12f62b815ddb868bbd23a36691e00d12e823205d9ec01e84e1ccf54d", "ja": "よく考えたら確かにそうかも……。\nあの、私たち、迷惑でしたか……？", "zh": "仔细想想，好像确实是这样……  \n那个，我们是不是给您添麻烦了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "5a5b8d364592e6d83d52ac1eec4e729741765d99a7c970a67076c579d849f2c3", "ja": "い、いえ！　問題ありませんわ。\nセレブとは、決して退かぬ者のこと……！", "zh": "不、不是！没问题的。\n所谓名媛，就是绝不退缩之人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "061806a92a663f77e4e3e092e95ad819d55000be679912f4427ad8f5a5bb2505", "ja": "（そうなのか？　いや、千鶴さんの覚悟は\nとても伝わってくるんだけど……大丈夫かな）", "zh": "（是这样吗？不，我确实能感受到千鹤小姐的决心……但她真的没问题吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "1de504a99aad66f7cce6a3d7c2d63a8d06f001c2bb149585ff07fcbe9781550d", "ja": "ここで退いてはセレブの名が廃ります。\n受けて立ちますわ！　はあっ！", "zh": "在这里退缩的话，可就有损名门千金的名声了。\n我接受你的挑战！哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1017_se", "source_sha256": "2100a665cc7df2bbd0de06fb778bf5744df92423c20dc46cb76bbbffe9da90c3", "ja": "ムシャッ！　パクッ！　モグモグ……", "zh": "大口吃！　咬一口！　嚼啊嚼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "b26d2ba12820da943d134e59a3d82a23df9d0befe047883968b16201654ff78c", "ja": "ズバリ！　マドレーヌはB、\nのど飴はAが高級なものですわ！", "zh": "没错！玛德琳是B，润喉糖则是A，都是高级货！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "98312aea2b0692a7aeaced2e850f0684a08ba06c935d379750f122e8113a154d", "ja": "す、すご～い！", "zh": "好、好厉害～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "98312aea2b0692a7aeaced2e850f0684a08ba06c935d379750f122e8113a154d", "ja": "す、すご～い！", "zh": "好、好厉害～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "e6ded95d11afb012b5cba0aad162ca796ba30513d5febb24ce1407030b7015d7", "ja": "わぁ、いっぺんに正解を出してしまったよぉ！\n千鶴お嬢さん、やっぱりすごいねぇ。", "zh": "哇，一下子就答对全部了呀！\n千鹤大小姐果然好厉害啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "8120381766deb2784ef1c46149a8c41ce4c30888171ed450fc60fae55b0ecf54", "ja": "あれこそが、本当のセレブの姿なのね……！", "zh": "那才是真正的名流姿态呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "46ef1a289cc5709ee455d1eac54ff2ab07187284a10a01a8edc3c48b5f9da92f", "ja": "また負けちゃった～！　でも楽しい～♪\nよーし、じゃあ次は～……！", "zh": "又输了～！不过好开心～♪\n好——那么接下来是～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "efa761a3cd7b7f16722a0bc53528f988a2bfc9df2838ff44f01e1ec00198e22c", "ja": "はあっ……はあっ……！", "zh": "哈啊……哈啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "38605071de0e0712d15cf013549346aef586dfe83a3dec48774c9daf612a60a7", "ja": "み、未来、可奈。対決はその辺にしておこう。\nそろそろ公演の打ち上げの時間だ。", "zh": "未、未来、可奈。先别比了，就到这里吧。\n差不多该到公演庆功宴的时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "0ab54c7ea9caaa2c4fdc49b714f97d4635e6a71300933a77a059ef9fddb5bb4a", "ja": "そうよ。ふたりとも、\n早く準備しないと置いてっちゃうわよ？", "zh": "没错。你们两个要是不快点准备，我可就先走了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "1267dc5e131d30c6e2cb93664782b49640ceb7bf3789f4d0f205ff8df13c594a", "ja": "そ、そんなぁ！\nすぐに用意してくるから、待ってて～！", "zh": "怎、怎么这样！\n我马上去准备，你等我哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "9716117ad0e056e0681190e5a947da3ce3d615da578284a637b37ac8c2c6bba4", "ja": "待ってよ可奈～！\nわ、私もすぐ準備しまーす！", "zh": "等等我呀可奈～！\n我、我也马上准备好——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1029_038chz", "source_sha256": "758da9a621a4e1a900083e9896b018481cef345f29ac797680d99527012e8d87", "ja": "ほっ……。", "zh": "呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "1232da3e4a287902371f3fd1690b32c3a8c84cf1f96df8c4378b21edf1573836", "ja": "（こうして、ひとつの戦いが幕を閉じた……\nだがそこに、さみしさや切なさの影はない）", "zh": "（就这样，一场战斗落下了帷幕……但其中并没有寂寞或悲伤的影子）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "5c808507d12e4deb6bbda5fe1430bcc5018a64459e92c233258e6e8d36b9225c", "ja": "（ライバルとして、仲間として、これからもアイドル達\nの戦いは続く。いつまで？　そう……いつまでもだ！）", "zh": "（无论是作为对手，还是作为伙伴，偶像们的战斗今后仍将继续。要持续到什么时候？没错……永远！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
